    "status": "present",
    "value": "You are stacking coloured blocks into a pyramid. The bottom row is given as a string of letters A-F. Each row above has one block fewer, and a block may sit on two adjacent blocks only if the triple (left, right, top) is in a list of allowed patterns. Decide whether some choice of blocks lets you build all the way up to a single top block."
  },
